{"id":"n42812-1-8","stage":2,"title":"널다 · 晾","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n42812-1-8-1","ko":"지수야, 이리 와서 빨래 너는 것 좀 도와줘.","zh":"智秀，过来帮忙晾衣服。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"이리","meaning":"往这边，朝这里","explanation":"이리：往这边，朝这里","readings":[{"term":"이리","audio":"/audio/062801c7a30dc6cea780.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91328","senseId":"1","lemma":"이리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"와서","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빨래","meaning":"要洗的衣服，洗完的衣服","explanation":"빨래：要洗的衣服，洗完的衣服","readings":[{"term":"빨래","audio":"/audio/811f604d9f69b6be72e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66638","senseId":"2","lemma":"빨래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너는","meaning":"晾，晒","explanation":"널다：晾，晒；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"널다","audio":"/audio/bbf6f4fc06c2e3e4b377.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42812","senseId":"1","lemma":"널다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도와줘.","meaning":"帮，帮助；表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","explanation":"돕다：帮，帮助；주다：表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"돕다","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3"},{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17203","senseId":"1","lemma":"돕다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"062801c7a30dc6ce","term":"이리","zh":"往这边，朝这里","audio":"/audio/062801c7a30dc6cea780.mp3","entryId":"91328","definition":"向着这个地方；或向着这个方向。","pronunciation":["이리"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"811f604d9f69b6be","term":"빨래","zh":"要洗的衣服，洗完的衣服","audio":"/audio/811f604d9f69b6be72e0.mp3","entryId":"66638","definition":"需要清洗或已经清洗过的衣物。","pronunciation":["빨래"]},{"id":"bbf6f4fc06c2e3e4","term":"널다","zh":"晾，晒","audio":"/audio/bbf6f4fc06c2e3e4b377.mp3","entryId":"42812","definition":"为晒干或晾干而铺开。","pronunciation":["널ː다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"7feaaecf170e0c6a","term":"돕다","zh":"帮，帮助","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3","entryId":"17203","definition":"给别人正在做的事打下手或添帮手。","pronunciation":["돕ː따"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/caef00c4255247eb863e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n42812-1-8-2","ko":"네. 지금 갈게요.","zh":"好，我这就来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在，这会儿","explanation":"지금：现在，这会儿","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62523","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갈게요.","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在，这会儿","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62523","definition":"在说话的当时；或此时此刻。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6b934c76c38832e0a0a1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.535,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=42812","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":86,"sequenceScore":2.3617,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["智秀，过来帮忙晾衣服。","好，我这就来。","听说你开了家新补习班，生意怎么样？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["智秀，过来帮忙晾衣服。","好，我这就来。","听说你开了家新补习班，生意怎么样？"],"answer":1}]}
